{"author":{"id":"836d943203cf5a4f01ab5d4b4780de84949c43734f2256a167cc5931ae5d8c66"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1794180724,"nonce":"tw5gHfZxHCMHEHCzoiOWp2o8Oh0=","title":"L5 — Cross-platform keyboard shortcuts and help overlay","message":"## Context\nThe only key handled is Escape → `CloseDetail` (`src/app.rs:1346-1353`). The Search pill sends `Message::Noop` (`src/ui/screen.rs:80`).\n\n## Files\n- `src/keymap.rs` — new, pure: `(Key, Modifiers, Context) -\u003e Option\u003cAction\u003e`\n- `src/app.rs:1343` — `subscription` routes key presses\n- `src/ui/screen.rs:80,846` — Search pill and search `text_input` (give it an `Id`)\n- `src/ui/shortcuts.rs` — new help overlay; follow the `done::overlay` stack/scrim pattern (`src/ui/done.rs:21`)\n\n## Approach\n- Use `Modifiers::command()` (`iced_core-0.14.0/src/keyboard/modifiers.rs:80`): Cmd on macOS, Ctrl on Linux and Windows. Hints render as `⌘K` on macOS and `Ctrl+K` elsewhere (`cfg!(target_os = \"macos\")`).\n- Bindings:\n  - Cmd+1…8: sections in `Section::ALL` order\n  - Cmd+B: toggle sidebar\n  - Cmd+K or Cmd+F: go to Issues and focus the search box (`text_input::focus(id)`)\n  - Cmd+Shift+L: cycle theme\n  - Cmd+R: rescan\n  - `j`/`k` or ↓/↑: move the selection in the Issues list\n  - Enter: open detail\n  - `x`: close or reopen the selected issue\n  - Esc: close the overlay, then detail\n  - `?` or Cmd+/: shortcut help\n- Single-key bindings only fire when the event status is `Ignored`, so typing in inputs is never hijacked\n- Feed the hints into the L4 tooltips (for example \"Search  ⌘K\")\n\n## Depends on\nL4 — the tooltip hint slot\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- Unit tests in `keymap.rs`: each binding with Cmd-style modifiers resolves to its action; `j` while focused in an input resolves to `None`\n- The Search pill and Cmd+K land focused in the Issues search box\n- `?` opens a help overlay listing every binding with platform-correct modifier glyphs\n- Gates pass","files":null}]}